        "question_6TM8ek": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Who We Are",
            "answer": "<p>LOVE MY HUMAN is a trading name of The Love My Human Group Limited, a company registered in England and Wales. Our registered office is located at 308 King’s Road, London, SW3 5UH, United Kingdom.</p><p>At LOVE MY HUMAN, we take your privacy seriously and are committed to protecting your personal information. We understand the importance of maintaining your trust and ensuring that any personal information you share with us is handled responsibly, securely and in accordance with applicable data protection legislation, including the UK General Data Protection Regulation (UK GDPR) and the Data Protection Act 2018.</p><p>This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, store, manage and protect your personal information when you visit our website, browse our products, create an account, place an order, subscribe to our communications or otherwise interact with LOVE MY HUMAN.</p><p>Throughout this Privacy Policy, references to \"LOVE MY HUMAN\", \"we\", \"us\" and \"our\" refer to The Love My Human Group Limited. References to \"you\" and \"your\" refer to any individual visiting our website, purchasing our products or interacting with our services.</p><p>We are responsible for deciding how and why your personal information is processed and are committed to ensuring that it is handled fairly, lawfully and transparently. We will only collect and use personal information where we have a legitimate reason and an appropriate legal basis to do so.</p><p>If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, how we handle your personal information or wish to exercise any of your data protection rights, please contact us at <a href=\"mailto:hello@lovemyhuman.co.uk\">hello@lovemyhuman.co.uk</a>.</p>",
            "bullets": "",
            "answer_after": ""
          }
        },
        "question_EwkQmN": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What Personal Information We Collect",
            "answer": "<p>When you visit the LOVE MY HUMAN website, create an account, place an order or interact with us, we may collect certain personal information to enable us to provide you with the best possible shopping experience and deliver our services effectively.</p><p>The information we collect may include your name, billing address, delivery address, email address, telephone number and other contact details. When you place an order with us, we also collect information relating to your purchase, including the products ordered, order history, delivery preferences and transaction details.</p><p>If you create an account with LOVE MY HUMAN, we may collect your account login details and information associated with your account, including your saved addresses, preferences and previous purchases.</p><p>We may also automatically collect certain technical information when you browse our website. This may include your IP address, browser type, device information, operating system, general location data, pages visited, products viewed and how you interact with our website. This information helps us understand how customers use our website and allows us to improve its performance, functionality and overall shopping experience.</p><p>Where you contact our customer care team, we may retain the information you provide, including your name, contact details, order references and the contents of your correspondence, so that we can respond to your enquiries and provide appropriate assistance.</p><p>We only collect personal information that is relevant and necessary for the purposes explained in this Privacy Policy. We do not knowingly collect more information than is reasonably required to operate our business, fulfil your orders, provide customer support and maintain our relationship with you.</p>",
            "bullets": "",
            "answer_after": ""
          }
        },
        "question_Km6Kte": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How We Use Your Information",
            "answer": "<p>At LOVE MY HUMAN, we use your personal information to provide you with a seamless, secure and personalised shopping experience. We are committed to using your information responsibly and only for purposes that are relevant to our business and our relationship with you.</p><p>When you place an order through our website, we use your personal information to process and fulfil your purchase, arrange payment, organise delivery and provide you with updates regarding your order. This includes contacting you if there are any issues with your purchase, delivery or payment, or if we need to provide important information relating to the products or services you have requested.</p><p>We may also use your information to manage your customer account, respond to enquiries, provide customer care and assist with returns, refunds or exchanges. Where necessary, we may use your details to verify your identity, prevent fraudulent transactions, protect our business and ensure the security of our website and customers.</p><p>We use information about how visitors interact with our website to better understand customer preferences, improve our website's functionality and performance, develop our products and services, and make the overall shopping experience more relevant and enjoyable.</p><p>Where you have chosen to receive marketing communications from us, we may use your contact details to send you information about new collections, products, promotions, special offers and other LOVE MY HUMAN news that we believe may be of interest to you. You can unsubscribe from marketing communications at any time.</p><p>We may also use your personal information where necessary to comply with our legal and regulatory obligations, enforce our terms and conditions, resolve disputes and protect the rights, property and interests of LOVE MY HUMAN and our customers.</p><p>We will not use your personal information for purposes that are incompatible with those explained in this Privacy Policy without first providing you with appropriate information and, where required by law, obtaining your consent.</p>",
            "bullets": "",
            "answer_after": ""
          }
        },
        "question_fUkhTL": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How We Collect Your Information",
            "answer": "<p>At LOVE MY HUMAN, we collect personal information in a number of ways, primarily when you interact with our website, make a purchase or communicate with us. We aim to be transparent about how information is obtained and ensure that it is collected fairly and lawfully.</p><p>Most of the personal information we hold is provided directly by you. This may happen when you create an account, place an order, complete a purchase, sign up to receive our newsletter or marketing communications, enter a promotion, contact our customer care team or otherwise provide information through our website.</p><p>We may also collect information automatically when you browse or interact with our website. This can include technical information about your device, browsing activity, IP address, website usage and preferences. We may use cookies and similar technologies to understand how visitors use our website, remember certain preferences and improve the overall online shopping experience. Further information about these technologies can be found in our Cookies section of this Privacy Policy.</p><p>In certain circumstances, we may receive information about you from trusted third parties who support our business operations. These may include payment providers, delivery and logistics companies, website hosting providers, analytics services and marketing platforms, where they are involved in providing services to us or supporting your interaction with LOVE MY HUMAN.</p><p>We may also receive information from publicly available sources where this is necessary and appropriate for legitimate business purposes, such as preventing fraud or verifying information.</p><p>Regardless of how your personal information is collected, we take appropriate steps to ensure that it is handled securely, used only for legitimate purposes and processed in accordance with applicable data protection laws.</p>",
            "bullets": "",
            "answer_after": ""
          }
        },
