        "question_VTW3bp": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Payment Information & Security",
            "answer": "<p>At LOVE MY HUMAN, we understand the importance of keeping your personal and financial information safe when shopping online. We take the security of your information seriously and work with established third-party payment providers to ensure that transactions made through our website are processed securely.</p><p>When you make a purchase, your payment information is collected and processed by our chosen payment service providers. We accept various payment methods, which may include credit and debit cards and other electronic payment services displayed at checkout. These providers are responsible for securely processing your payment in accordance with their own privacy and security policies.</p><p>We do not intend to store or retain full payment card details, including your complete card number or security code, on our own systems. Where payment providers offer a secure card-saving facility for future purchases, any stored payment credentials are managed in accordance with the provider's security arrangements.</p><p>We may receive limited payment-related information, such as transaction references, payment status and confirmation details, which we use to manage orders, process refunds, respond to payment enquiries and maintain accurate business records.</p><p>Our website uses appropriate security measures designed to protect the personal information submitted through our online services. However, no method of transmitting or storing information electronically can be guaranteed to be completely secure.</p><p>We encourage customers to take appropriate precautions when shopping online, including keeping account passwords confidential and notifying us immediately if they suspect any unauthorised access to their LOVE MY HUMAN account.</p><p>For further information about how your payment information is handled, we recommend reviewing the privacy policies of the relevant payment providers.</p>",
            "bullets": "",
            "answer_after": ""
          }
        },
        "question_wKbTHq": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Cookies & Website Tracking",
            "answer": "<p>At LOVE MY HUMAN, we use cookies and similar technologies to help ensure that our website functions effectively and to provide you with a smooth, convenient and personalised shopping experience.</p><p>Cookies are small text files that are placed on your computer, mobile phone or other device when you visit a website. They allow the website to recognise your device, remember certain information about your visit and help improve how the website operates.</p><p>We may use different types of cookies for a variety of purposes. Essential cookies are necessary for our website to function properly and enable features such as navigating the website, adding products to your shopping basket, completing purchases and accessing your account. Other cookies may help us remember your preferences, understand how visitors use our website and improve its performance.</p><p>We may also use analytical and performance cookies to collect information about how visitors interact with our website, including which pages are visited most frequently, which products attract the most interest and whether visitors experience any technical difficulties. This information helps us better understand our customers and continually improve our website and services.</p><p>Where applicable, we may use advertising and marketing cookies or similar tracking technologies to help us deliver more relevant advertising, measure the effectiveness of marketing campaigns and understand how customers interact with our advertisements across different platforms.</p><p>Some cookies may be placed by third-party services that appear on or support our website. These third parties may collect information about your browsing activity in accordance with their own privacy policies.</p><p>You can manage your cookie preferences through our website's cookie consent settings, where available. You can also adjust your browser settings to block or delete cookies. Please be aware that disabling certain cookies may affect the functionality of our website and some features may not operate as intended.</p><p>Where required by law, we will ask for your consent before placing non-essential cookies or using similar tracking technologies on your device. You can change or withdraw your consent at any time through the available cookie settings.</p>",
            "bullets": "",
            "answer_after": "<p>Please bring your dog's up-to-date vaccination record.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_9gHBti": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Marketing & Email Communications",
            "answer": "<p>At LOVE MY HUMAN, we love keeping our customers informed about our latest collections, new arrivals, exclusive offers and everything happening across our brand. From time to time, we may send you marketing communications and updates that we believe may be of interest to you.</p><p>If you choose to subscribe to our newsletter or opt in to receive marketing communications, we may use your name and email address to send you information about new products, seasonal collections, special promotions, events, exclusive offers and other LOVE MY HUMAN news.</p><p>We may also use information about your previous purchases, browsing activity and preferences to make our communications more relevant to your interests and shopping habits, where permitted by applicable data protection laws.</p><p>We will only send you direct marketing communications where we have an appropriate legal basis to do so. You are always in control of your marketing preferences and can choose to stop receiving promotional emails at any time by clicking the unsubscribe link included at the bottom of our marketing emails.</p><p>Please note that even if you unsubscribe from marketing communications, we may still need to contact you with important non-promotional messages relating to your orders, purchases, account, deliveries, returns, refunds or other customer service matters.</p><p>We will never require you to receive marketing communications as a condition of making a purchase from LOVE MY HUMAN. Your decision to subscribe or unsubscribe will not affect your ability to shop with us or use our website.</p><p>We respect your preferences and are committed to ensuring that any marketing communications we send are relevant, appropriate and handled in accordance with applicable privacy and electronic marketing regulations.</p>",
            "bullets": "",
            "answer_after": "<p>Please bring your dog's up-to-date vaccination record.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_wPqNHC": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Sharing Your Personal Information",
            "answer": "<p>At LOVE MY HUMAN, we respect your privacy and understand the importance of keeping your personal information confidential. We do not sell your personal information to third parties. However, in order to operate our business, fulfil your orders and provide you with our services, it may be necessary to share certain information with carefully selected third-party companies and service providers.</p><p>These may include payment processing providers who securely handle transactions, delivery and logistics partners who require your name and delivery address to fulfil orders, and website hosting and technology providers who help us operate and maintain our website.</p><p>We may also share relevant information with customer service platforms, email and marketing service providers, website analytics providers and other business partners who assist us in managing our day-to-day operations and improving the services we offer. These organisations are only permitted to use your information where necessary to provide services to us or for other lawful purposes.</p><p>In certain circumstances, we may also disclose personal information where required to do so by law, regulation, court order or a request from an authorised regulatory or law enforcement authority. We may also share information where reasonably necessary to protect our legal rights, prevent fraud, investigate suspected unlawful activity or safeguard the security of our business and customers.</p><p>Where we use third-party service providers, we take reasonable steps to ensure that appropriate contractual, technical and organisational safeguards are in place to protect your personal information and that it is handled in accordance with applicable data protection legislation.</p><p>We aim to ensure that any sharing of personal information is limited to what is necessary for the relevant purpose and that your privacy is respected at every stage.</p>",
            "bullets": "",
            "answer_after": "<p>Please bring your dog's up-to-date vaccination record.</p>"
          }
        }
